### Create Admin
POST http://localhost:3000/users
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "name": "Ayush",
    "username": "ayushadmin",
    "email": "ayush@example.com",
    "password": "mysecretpassword",
    "role": "admin"
}

### Test Login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "ayushadmin",
    "password": "mysecretpassword"
}

